vaScript.%0Aconst%20family%20%3D%20%28language%29%20%3D%3E%20%28language%20%3D%3D%3D%20%27Rust%27%20%3F%20%27Rust%27%20%3A%20%27JavaScript%27%29%3B%0Aconst%20sha256%20%3D%20%28text%29%20%3D%3E%20createHash%28%27sha256%27%29.update%28Buffer.from%28text%2C%20%27utf8%27%29%29.digest%28%27hex%27%29%3B%0A%0A%2F%2A%2A%0A%20%2A%20Translates%20%60source%60%20from%20%60sourceLanguage%60%20to%20%60targetLanguage%60%2C%20each%20one%20of%0A%20%2A%20%7B%40link%20SELF_TRANSLATION_LANGUAGES%7D%20or%20an%20alias%20of%20one.%0A%20%2A%0A%20%2A%20The%20result%20is%20%60%7B%20sourceLanguage%2C%20targetLanguage%2C%20code%2C%20items%20%7D%60.%20Each%20item%0A%20%2A%20%60%7B%20term%2C%20start%2C%20end%2C%20status%2C%20reason%20%7D%60%20is%20a%20top-level%20item%20of%20the%20source%0A%20%2A%20%28byte%20offsets%29%20with%20its%20status%3A%20%60kept%60%20%28same%20language%29%2C%20%60translated%60%2C%0A%20%2A%20%60restored%60%20%28provenance%20gave%20back%20its%20source%29%2C%20%60comment%60%2C%20%60provenance%60%20%28a%0A%20%2A%20self-translation%20header%20or%20prelude%29%20or%20%60carried%60%2C%20with%20the%20reason%20it%20was%0A%20%2A%20carried.%0A%20%2A%0A%20%2A%20%60options.decorators%60%20%28a%20DecoratorSet%20or%20an%20array%20of%20decorators%29%20decorates%0A%20%2A%20each%20translated%20item%20at%20the%20%60emitter%60%20level%2C%20one%20%60%7B%20format%2C%20number%2C%20line%20%7D%60%0A%20%2A%20record%20per%20line%20of%20its%20definitions%20with%20the%20target%20language%20as%20%60format%60%2C%0A%20%2A%20before%20its%20provenance%20is%20recorded%2C%20so%20a%20translation%20can%20be%20brought%20to%20match%0A%20%2A%20hand-written%20code%20and%20still%20restores%20its%20source.%0A%20%2A%0A%20%2A%20From%20JavaScript%20or%20TypeScript%20into%20Rust%2C%20an%20item%20may%20call%20and%20read%20the%0A%20%2A%20module%27s%20other%20top-level%20items%3A%20each%20item%20is%20translated%20after%20the%20items%20it%0A%20%2A%20names%2C%20with%20the%20signatures%20of%20those%20that%20translated%20boun