urn%20-1%3B%0A%20%20if%20%28depth%20%3D%3D%3D%200%29%20%7B%0A%20%20%20%20if%20%28kind%20%3D%3D%3D%20%27identifier%27%20%26%26%20%28value%20%3D%3D%3D%20%27const%27%20%7C%7C%20value%20%3D%3D%3D%20%27let%27%29%29%20return%203%3B%0A%20%20%20%20if%20%28kind%20%3D%3D%3D%20%27punct%27%20%26%26%20value%20%3D%3D%3D%20%27%2C%27%20%26%26%20declaration%29%20return%204%3B%0A%20%20%20%20if%20%28kind%20%3D%3D%3D%20%27punct%27%20%26%26%20value%20%3D%3D%3D%20%27%3B%27%29%20return%205%3B%0A%20%20%20%20if%20%28kind%20%3D%3D%3D%20%27identifier%27%20%26%26%20%28value%20%3D%3D%3D%20%27return%27%20%7C%7C%20value%20%3D%3D%3D%20%27throw%27%20%7C%7C%20value%20%3D%3D%3D%20%27function%27%0A%20%20%20%20%20%20%7C%7C%20value%20%3D%3D%3D%20%27if%27%20%7C%7C%20value%20%3D%3D%3D%20%27while%27%20%7C%7C%20value%20%3D%3D%3D%20%27for%27%20%7C%7C%20value%20%3D%3D%3D%20%27switch%27%20%7C%7C%20value%20%3D%3D%3D%20%27class%27%0A%20%20%20%20%20%20%7C%7C%20value%20%3D%3D%3D%20%27break%27%20%7C%7C%20value%20%3D%3D%3D%20%27continue%27%20%7C%7C%20value%20%3D%3D%3D%20%27try%27%20%7C%7C%20value%20%3D%3D%3D%20%27import%27%20%7C%7C%20value%20%3D%3D%3D%20%27export%27%29%29%20return%205%3B%0A%20%20%7D%0A%20%20if%20%28kind%20%3D%3D%3D%20%27punct%27%20%26%26%20%28value%20%3D%3D%3D%20%27%7B%27%20%7C%7C%20value%20%3D%3D%3D%20%27%28%27%20%7C%7C%20value%20%3D%3D%3D%20%27%5B%27%29%29%20return%201%3B%0A%20%20if%20%28kind%20%3D%3D%3D%20%27punct%27%20%26%26%20%28value%20%3D%3D%3D%20%27%7D%27%20%7C%7C%20value%20%3D%3D%3D%20%27%29%27%20%7C%7C%20value%20%3D%3D%3D%20%27%5D%27%29%29%20return%202%3B%0A%20%20return%200%3B%0A%7D%0A%0A%2F%2A%2A%20%40param%20%7Bboolean%7D%20thenTerminates%20%40param%20%7Bboolean%7D%20hasOtherwise%20%40param%20%7Bboolean%7D%20otherwiseTerminates%20%40returns%20%7Bboolean%7D%20%2A%2F%0Aexport%20function%20requireJavaScriptBranchContinuation%28thenTerminates%2C%20hasOtherwise%2C%20otherwiseTerminates%29%20%7B%0A%20%20return%20%21thenTerminates%20%7C%7C%20hasOtherwise%20%26%26%20%21otherwiseTerminates%3B%0A%7D%0A%0A%2F%2A%2A%0A%20%2A%20Preserve%20lexical%20shadowing%20while%20projecting%20a%20known%20constructor%27s%20fields.%0A%20%2A%20Zero%20keeps%20a%20shadowed%20body%2C%20one%20rewrites%20the%20subject%2C%20and%20two%20also%20follows%0A%20%2A%20an%20actual%20direct%20alias%20initialized%20from%20that%20same%20subject%20binding.%0A%20%2A%20%40param%20%7Bstring%7D%20bindingName%20%40param%20%7Bstring%7D%20subject%20%40param%20%7Bstring%7D%20valueKind%0A%20%2A%20%40param%20%7Bnumber%7D%20pathLength%20%40param%20%7Bstring%7D%20valueName%20%40returns%20%7Bnumber%7D%0A%20%2A%2F%0Aexport%20function%20readJavaScriptFieldSubstitutionPlan%28bindingName%2C%20subject%2C%20valueKind%2C%20pathLength%2C%20valueName%29%20%7B%0A%20%20if%20%28bindingName%20%3D%3D%3D%20subject%29%20return%200%3B%0A%20%20if%20%28valueKind%20%3D%3D%3D%20%27name%27%20%26%26%20pathLength%20%3D%3D%3D%201%20%26%26%20valueName%20%3D%3D%3D%20subject%29%20return%202%3B%0A%20%20return%201%3B%0A%7D%0A%0A%2F%2A%2A%0A%20%2A%20Under%20the%20existing%20standard-array-iteration%20model%2C%20a%20fresh%20dense%20literal%0A%20%2A%20supplies%20every%20flat%20mutable%20binding%20without%20a%20missing%20element%2C%20default%20or%0A%20%2A%20rest%20operation.%20Freshness%20does%20not%20prove%20an%20unmodified%20ambient%20iterator.%0A%20%2A%20The%20host%20retains%20one%20initializer%20evaluation%20and%20passes%20each%20selected%20element%0A%20%2A%20to%20the%20existing%20let%20lowering.%20Other%20forms%20keep%20their%20original%20refusal.%0A%20%2A%20%40param%20%7Bstring%7D%20valueKind%20%40param%20%7Bnumber%7D%20itemCount%0A%20%2A%20%40param%20%7Bnumber%7D%20bindingCount%20%40param%20%7Bboolean%7D%20plainBindings%0A%20%2A%20%40param%20%7Bboolean%7D%20hasSpread%20%40returns%20%7Bboolean%7D%0A%20%2A%2F%0Aexport%20function%20acceptJavaScriptMutableArrayBinding%28valueKind%2C%20itemCount%2C%20bindingCount%2C%20plainBindings%2C%20hasSpread%29%20%7B%0A%20%20return%20typeof%20itemCount%20%3D%3D%3D%20%27number%27%20%26%26%20valueKind